# Cyberpunk 2077: DLSS and frame generation need NVIDIA's API exposed and the NGX libraries updated.
# summary: Skips the launcher, DLSS and frame generation on, DLSS libraries kept current
# Steam starts redprelauncher.exe (its Windows launch entry), CDPR's launcher; go straight into the game instead, as
# the benchmark does.
EXTRA_ARGS=--launcher-skip
PROTON_ENABLE_NVAPI=1
PROTON_ENABLE_NGX_UPDATER=1
